  itemUses:
  - I have never ever owned a kite before!
  - The weather is too good to waste it indoors.
  - I am bored and I want to try something fun!
  - The wind is perfect here! I want to see how high it can fly!
  - I saw a kid playing with one in a magazine the other day and I got jealous...
